      "statement": "The ingestion pipeline is an event-driven system where an EventBridge-triggered Master Crawler dispatches tasks to an SQS queue; these tasks trigger a Manifest Crawler for deduplication via S3 and raw data storage, which in turn triggers a Worker Lambda to chunk, embed via Bedrock, and store data in Qdrant while updating document status in DynamoDB.",
